**Business Development and Publishing Strategy Overview**

As of Q4 2023, **TechNova Interactive** has initiated a strategic alliance with **Epic Games** and **Unity Technologies**, focusing on the development of cross-platform games utilizing the **Unreal Engine 5** and **Unity 2023**. This partnership aims to leverage the expertise of **Lead Developer Sarah Johnson** and **Creative Director Michael Chen** to create immersive gameplay experiences targeted at both mobile and console users. The projected timeline for the first release is set for **June 2024**.

Monetization strategies will revolve around in-app purchases and subscription models, with a target revenue of **$5 million** in the first year post-launch. To enhance user engagement, we will implement a tiered rewards system, utilizing insights from **Market Analyst Lisa Huang** and **User Experience Specialist James Patel**.

### Development and Publishing Timeline

| Phase              | Start Date  | End Date    | Responsible Entities                     |
|--------------------|-------------|-------------|------------------------------------------|
| Concept Development | Jan 2024   | Mar 2024    | Sarah Johnson, Michael Chen              |
